### Postman ki jagah: VS Code "REST Client" extension se har request ke upar "Send Request" dabao
@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

GET {{base}}/health

### Register
# @name reg
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Araham", "email": "araham@example.com", "password": "supersecret1" }

### Login
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "araham@example.com", "password": "supersecret1" }

### Me
@token = {{login.response.body.data.token}}
GET {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a post
# @name post
POST {{base}}/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Hello Express++", "body": "My first C++ backend", "tags": ["cpp"], "published": true }

### List posts
GET {{base}}/posts?tags=cpp&sort=-createdAt&page=1&limit=10

### Update
PATCH {{base}}/posts/{{post.response.body.data._id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Updated title" }

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/posts/{{post.response.body.data._id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
